    {
      "page": 10,
      "what": "The skill table's ticks are glyphs the reading-order text drops; read from the -layout text's tick columns. The table has five columns and no Special column, so the warband has no skill group of its own."
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "what": "The Choice of warriors says up to five Eunuchs while the Eunuch entry on page 11 is headed 0-3. Read as 0-3, which is the count that makes the page's own arithmetic work: 1 Slave Merchant + 1 Overseer + 3 Caravan Guards + 3 Eunuchs + 1 Ogre + 3 Hounds is the maximum of 12 the page says hiring gives."
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "what": "The Eunuch's Leadership is printed as 10, higher than any hero's; imported as printed."
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "what": "The Slave is sold on the list at 8 dinars to heroes only. No profile, rules or model count are printed for him here, so he is a bare stub and nothing is added to the roster."
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "what": "The rules name a slave's own special rules - stupidity, I'm outta here, a new slave's profile - which this PDF never prints. They belong to the campaign's own rules, not read here."
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "what": "The Trapper's Pole is 15 dinars Rare 6 and the Manacles 20+D6 Rare 8, both Slavers only; the list prices the Manacles at a flat 20, and the entry's dice are kept."
